            "icon": "box",
            "content": "<p><strong>Essential Kit:</strong> roller, magnetic angle block (15°/20°), diamond discs 400 and 1000 grit.</p><p><strong>Complete Kit:</strong> roller, magnetic angle block (15°/20°), 6 discs: diamond 240, 600, 1000; whetstone 1200; 5000; polishing 10000.</p><p><strong>Gift Set:</strong> 2 Essential Kits.</p><p>Ships in plain protective packaging, ready for your own gift wrap.</p>",
