    "problem": {
      "type": "ns-ks-split",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Cooking isn't supposed to be like this",
        "heading": "Your Knives Have Been Dull Long Enough.",
        "text": "<p>A dull knife doesn't just slow you down. It slips, it tears, and it turns a quick dinner into a fight with a tomato.</p><p>Pull-through sharpeners grind at a fixed slot. Whetstones take practice to master. Sharpening services cost money per knife and keep your knives for days.</p><p>There's an easier way.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/ks-dull-tomato.png",
        "image_left": false,
        "light": false
      }
    },
    "intro": {
      "type": "ns-ks-features",
      "blocks": {
        "f1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Wood-grain roller",
            "text": "<p>A solid, weighted roller with stainless steel ends. It rolls smoothly along the blade and feels good in the hand.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Magnetic angle block",
            "text": "<p>Strong magnets hold the knife flat against the steel face so the angle stays the same on every pass. One face is 15°, the other 20°.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Coarse diamond disc",
            "text": "<p>Resets a dull edge and cleans up small nicks. Start here when a knife has stopped cutting: about 20–30 passes per side.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Fine diamond disc",
            "text": "<p>Refines the edge into a clean, sharp cut for everyday cooking: about 10–15 passes per side.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Whetstone and fine discs (Complete Kit)",
            "text": "<p>The 1200 and 5000 grit discs smooth the edge and remove the tiny burr left by the diamond discs, so the knife glides with less drag.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Polishing disc (Complete Kit)",
            "text": "<p>The 10000 grit disc gives a very smooth, polished finish. A few gentle passes per side are enough.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "f1",
        "f2",
        "f3",
